Graffik NG is a spiritual successor to Dynamic Perception's Graffik software.
It contains no code from the GPL-licensed Graffik family; the NMX protocol is
implemented fresh from Dynamic Perception's published protocol documentation
(see docs/adr/0003). Gratitude to Dynamic Perception, LLC for open-sourcing
their firmware, applications, and protocol documents.
